id: emperor
name: Emperor
order: 8
category: body
# A Factor Trait replaces a Secondary Racial Trait - Secondary, then, unless it names a Primary one to replace.
importance: secondary
# Under the "Arcosian Factor Trait" header: a Arcosian's alone - shown, never enforced.
race: arcosian
description: >
  Your power is so immense it must be held back lest it destroy all those around you.
text: >
  Emperor (Body): Your power is so immense it must be held back lest it destroy all those around you.
  (1)-[Passive]: Gain access to all stages of the Metamorphosis Transformation Line.
  (2)-[Passive]: All of your Forms with a Racial Requirement of Arcosian are considered to be a part of the Metamorphosis Transformation Line for your effects.
  (3)-[Triggered]: Upon using the Transformation Maneuver, you may spend any amount of Overwhelm Stacks to increase your Stress Bonus by 1 for every 2 stacks of Overwhelm spent for the duration of that Maneuver.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: Upon benefiting from the effects of Legend Realized, maximize your Overwhelm stacks.
  (5)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: At the end of your turn, before you apply the second effect of Overwhelming Fighter, you may use the Transformation Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver if you are below the Injured Health Threshold.

---

# (1), (2) Wait on Transformations - Forms and Transformation Lines - not built yet: the table's.
[passive]
# (3) The Transformation Maneuver's window: the Overwhelm spent, 1 on its Stress Test for every 2 (chat.mjs askTransformation).
allow emperor.stress;

# (4) Legend Realized benefited from (chat.mjs legendRealized): your Overwhelm to its most. Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic
# button.
[triggered/legend-realized, 1/round, effect 4]
fillResource(overwhelm);

# (5) Not built: the Transformation out of sequence between your turn's end and Overwhelming Fighter's (2) is the table's - Transformations
# are not built either.
